   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi, <div><br></div><div>I ran a branch-site test with codeml and now I want to import the output to ggtree to visualise the results but I am having troubles importing the mlc file. This is my code and the error I&#39;m getting:</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11.4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">mlcfile</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- </span>&quot;~/Desktop/BIOMICS/TESIS_MAESTRIA/COMPARATIVE_GENOMICS/PositiveSelectionScan/Insulin_branch_site/Insulin_17genomes/Codeml_Setup_Inferred_Genetree_Insulin_seqs/insulin_CDS_alignment_Gb/insulin_CDS_alignment_Gb/m3Discrtk3/Omega10/out&quot;</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11.4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(176,22,0);min-height:15px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11.4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">mlc_tree</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span>&lt;-<span style=\"color:#b01600\"> </span>read.codeml_mlc(<span style=\"color:#000000\">mlcfile</span>)</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11.4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">Error in i:j : argument of length 0<br></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11.4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;font-size:11.4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Monaco;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153);font-family:Monaco;font-size:11.4px\"><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;text-indent:0px\">I would also like to know if the function </span>read.codeml_mlc() </span>only reads outputs from site tests, given that branch-site tests don&#39;t have a tree, just the selected sites. I also tried to import the output from a site-test and I get exactly the same error: <span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153);font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px\">Error in i:j : argument of length 0</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153);font-family:Monaco;font-size:11px\"><br></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Attached is the output mlc file from the branch-site test. </font></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\" size=\"2\">Any suggestion is very welcome, thanks!</font></p></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
